infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Three UNION ALL queries vs one GROUPING SETS
  desc Per-status + per-user + grand total on a 12M-row orders table
  compares
    - label UNION ALL — 3 queries
      children
        - label 3 independent Seq Scans
          desc One full scan per grouping branch
        - label 36M rows read
          desc 12M-row table re-read three times
        - label ~2.4 s total
          desc Roughly 3 × 800 ms per scan
        - label Drifts out of sync
          desc Fix one branch, the others lag
    - label GROUPING SETS — 1 query
      children
        - label 1 Seq Scan
          desc Feeds a MixedAggregate in one pass
        - label 12M rows read
          desc The table is read exactly once
        - label ~950 ms
          desc All three groupings from one scan
        - label Single source of truth
          desc Branches cannot drift apart
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
